{"id": "DfPZYn0RLpb", "title": "Video by anim_aman", "description": "Bulleh Shah ka murshid usse rooth gaya, toh nawab ka beta galiyon mein nacha… jab tak darwaza khul na gaya 🤍\n\nRab ko manana aasaan tha: do nafl padhe, aur woh raazi.\nPar jab murshid Shah Inayat ne apne baagh ka darwaza band kar diya, Bulleh ne ghungroo baandhe aur raat-raat bhar us darwaze ke bahar nacha.\nEk raat darwaza khula. Boodhe baaghbaan ne use utha ke seene se laga liya.\nMera piya ghar aaya.\n\n🎵 Piya Ghar Aaya · Fareed Ayaz & Abu Muhammad Qawwal and Brothers · Coke Studio (kalam: Bulleh Shah)\n\nSend this to the one you’d dance in the streets for 🤍\n\nPiya Ghar Aaya | Bulleh Shah | Shah Inayat | Fareed Ayaz | Abu Muhammad | Coke Studio | qawwali | Sufi kalam | murshid | Lahore\n\n#BullehShah #PiyaGharAaya #Sufi", "channel": "anim_aman", "uploader_id": "52657595533", "uploader": "Aman", "timestamp": 1793625638, "like_count": 53242, "comment_count": 41, "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/146.0.0.0 Safari/537.36", "Accept": "text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,*/*;q=0.8", "Accept-Language": "en-us,en;q=0.5", "Sec-Fetch-Mode": "navigate", "Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-1678322750688064a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 67.137, "asr": 44100, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://scontent-ord5-1.cdninstagram.com/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQNjvbqG3g-_XCBcHvE1WQhTMcQleNsLXuTUc_48b2Uw2dD5XtSPzSlsVqRkEkpx5XbIlUCjqVv1KeU__anhyiXK1uBA8E6DT-KWT3Q.mp4?_nc_cat=111&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_ohc=16xkCQAvE4kQ7kNvwFr2_y9&&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=BDTVedX6gvHsuTZixEMZSQ&_nc_ss=70689&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQRIU_Mn81eprZp7Gi-TNk16iL-3Tg5uuJfDpzfsyLlD_g&oe=6AF3DC54", "manifest_stream_number": 0, "is_dash_periods": true, "protocol": "https", "audio_ext": "m4a", "video_ext": "none", "vbr": 0, "ab